 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` now validates a tool call's `input` against the tool's declared `inputSchema` before
+  running the executor. Input the schema rejects is answered with a `ToolResponse` describing what was wrong
+  (property path and failed constraint, never the value), so the model can correct the call on its next round;
+  the executor never sees it. `ajv` 6 is now a runtime dependency, so `inputSchema` is read as JSON Schema draft-07.
+
